cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "SynNotch-PiggyBac gene circuit: computational analysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and outputs supporting the Section 4 computational analysis of
  Gupta and Gupta (2026), Frontiers in Aging Neuroscience. Contains the EEG
  simulation, the coherence and statistics pipeline, the leave-one-out
  classification workflow, the Figure 2 script, and an independent
  reimplementation depending on NumPy alone.
type: software
license: MIT
